WEBVTT

field-note-1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
September 10, 2026, American Samoa. A dive
team filmed an isopod moving over the
seafloor. NOAA says it may be a new species.

field-note-2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Watch how it moves. What can you tell from a
video?

field-note-3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
In a separate November 2026 trial off
Hawaiʻi, NOAA is testing untethered robots
for mapping and collecting samples.

field-note-4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
What would you compare before calling it a
new species? Bring the question to a Circle.
